                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2632775f-c01f-3d77-a0ea-4161d978978f",
                        "entry_id": "77d1d73b-b752-3eaf-ab38-d09cb8e0dc5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного совестливый; склонность поступать по совести"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b45d3eb7-cb81-4658-b722-abc623d0d689",
                                "sense_id": "2632775f-c01f-3d77-a0ea-4161d978978f",
                                "text": "Кити знала, что эта неискренность его происходила от любви к брату, от чувства совестливости за то, что он слишком счастлив, и в особенности от не оставляющего его желания быть лучше, — она любила это в нём и потому улыбалась."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa23c23f-41d2-49fb-a5be-81cbb14f9081",
                        "source_entry_id": "77d1d73b-b752-3eaf-ab38-d09cb8e0dc5a",
                        "source_sense_id": "2632775f-c01f-3d77-a0ea-4161d978978f",
                        "target_lang_word": "conscientiousness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conscientiousness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9d628ac-50db-3560-8b42-ad5864eafdeb",
                                        "entry_id": "cb75c564-6fc3-3b19-b93c-c11b655a8b46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or characteristic of being conscientious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "981cc541-0d69-4b1d-914e-0643d0fc2d06",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d628ac-50db-3560-8b42-ad5864eafdeb",
                                                "text": "It is a terrible thing a Man should be put to Death for a Crime he is not Guilty of; yet so oddly Circumstances may meet in the infinite variety of Accidents, that it is possible it should come to pass, all the Wisdom that Judges, and Conscientiousness that Juries may be possess'd of, notwithstanding."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6439b01-0710-4e78-93a8-bad99346cc9d",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d628ac-50db-3560-8b42-ad5864eafdeb",
                                                "text": "We come now to the greatest and noblest of the Moral Powers of Man; to that power which makes him quite a different order of being from any other that we know of, and which is the glory and crown of his existence:—his Conscientiousness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84c40821-892f-4224-9aeb-c87679b60b10",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d628ac-50db-3560-8b42-ad5864eafdeb",
                                                "text": "It seems evident that those who have expressed the view that the following of personal inclination is sometimes morally better than conscientiousness are confusing this issue with another to which we must next give attention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a91aaa9-eba2-4a7f-844c-d77526590777",
                        "source_entry_id": "77d1d73b-b752-3eaf-ab38-d09cb8e0dc5a",
                        "source_sense_id": "2632775f-c01f-3d77-a0ea-4161d978978f",
                        "target_lang_word": "tenderness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tenderness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6941c6d0-6cf9-3818-9291-f65c7f46cab0",
                                        "entry_id": "fd24aee1-de57-3881-ac0f-2a5b5bff833f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tendency to express warm, compassionate feelings."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e00d6ff4-4459-4112-9015-bd7211d76a3b",
                                                "sense_id": "6941c6d0-6cf9-3818-9291-f65c7f46cab0",
                                                "text": "When the lovers were together, their cold indifference gave way to love and tenderness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2b3be4e-dbac-4f9f-a68a-7c1c5ddca360",
                                                "sense_id": "6941c6d0-6cf9-3818-9291-f65c7f46cab0",
                                                "text": "I had known him jealous, suspicious; I had seen about him certain tendernesses, fitfulnesses—a softness which came like a warm air, and a ruth which passed like early dew, dried in the heat of his irritabilities: this was all I had seen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b8b6812-4d12-404a-bc6b-813fbeec3c94",
                                                "sense_id": "6941c6d0-6cf9-3818-9291-f65c7f46cab0",
                                                "text": "Love me, try to be understanding / Tenderness is all that I'm asking / Don't feel like I'm making conditions / I want to overcome my inhibitions"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "079488f0-bb7c-3c07-976d-b2f71f580ede",
                                        "entry_id": "fd24aee1-de57-3881-ac0f-2a5b5bff833f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A concern for the feelings or welfare of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98c4063b-7cf4-47f6-b543-2c383550d5cb",
                                                "sense_id": "079488f0-bb7c-3c07-976d-b2f71f580ede",
                                                "text": "When they saw the poor orphans, they were overwhelmed with tenderness for them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e414184b-6466-4038-a4d3-88bcac8bd1e6",
                                                "sense_id": "079488f0-bb7c-3c07-976d-b2f71f580ede",
                                                "text": "Everybody needs a little tenderness sometimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28b2fa57-649a-483c-800d-1ed4add66bbe",
                                                "sense_id": "079488f0-bb7c-3c07-976d-b2f71f580ede",
                                                "text": "Quiet people too, for I think that about this time a sort of remorseful tenderness comes over the bullies and the nagsters, so that they go about gently and deprecatingly, hoping by one day's record sweetness to outface the year's blusterings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63be1d8c-dfd1-305f-8992-93bbbf590efc",
                                        "entry_id": "fd24aee1-de57-3881-ac0f-2a5b5bff833f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pain or discomfort when an affected area is touched."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b84d9696-ee46-4e78-9355-6b630d3836ca",
                                                "sense_id": "63be1d8c-dfd1-305f-8992-93bbbf590efc",
                                                "text": "He noted her extreme tenderness when he touched the bruise on her thigh."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d84c563c-bca3-4ab2-80ce-6ac815af45fb",
                                                "sense_id": "63be1d8c-dfd1-305f-8992-93bbbf590efc",
                                                "text": "Amies Oelschlager said in a statement that oral contraceptives that contain estrogen may cause side effects such as headaches, nausea, and breast tenderness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
